  "description": "Critical Strike: Because Vaal Storm Call is only a single spell, its critical strike chance is only rolled once. If it crits, every lightning strike including the final bolt will be a critical strike. If it doesn't crit, none of them will be.\nCast Speed: Affects the speed of the initial Vaal Storm Call cast, but does not affect the skill's periodic lightning strikes.",
  "stats": [
    "Deals (21-510) to (38-947) Lightning Damage",
    "Base duration is 6.00 seconds",
    "Modifiers to Skill Effect Duration also apply to this Skill's Soul Gain Prevention",
    "Strikes an Enemy every 0.25 seconds"
  ],
  "gemDescription": "Sets a marker at a location. Lightning strikes random enemies around the marker repeatedly over the skill's duration, dealing damage in an area around the strike. Modifiers to the skill's duration will also affect the delay between these strikes. When the duration ends, a large bolt of lightning strikes the marker, dealing damage around it.",
